  "Identificar brechas, fortalezas y decisiones con mayor impacto potencial.": "Identify gaps, strengths and decisions with the greatest potential impact.",
  "Imaginamos estudiantes que conocen su siguiente paso, docentes que reciben señales útiles e instituciones que detectan brechas antes de que se vuelvan fracaso. Esa visión exige colaboración entre educación, ciencia, tecnología y liderazgo. SEEDMAX nace para construir esa infraestructura de decisiones y ponerla al servicio del talento latinoamericano.": "We imagine students who know their next step, teachers who receive useful signals and institutions that detect gaps before they become failure. That vision requires collaboration between education, science, technology and leadership. SEEDMAX was born to build this decision infrastructure and put it at the service of Latin American talent.",
